<div class="container">
  <header class="generator-header"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ERROR, A LITTLE LAUGH.</span><div class="title-row"><h1>Bug Generator</h1><div class="ladybug-stage" data-controller="ladybug">
      <svg class="ladybug-thread" aria-hidden="true"><path data-ladybug-target="thread" d="M28 0 L28 45" /></svg>
      <button type="button" class="ladybug-handle" aria-label="MizeLyのてんとう虫を揺らす" data-ladybug-target="bug" data-action="pointerdown->ladybug#grab pointermove->ladybug#move pointerup->ladybug#release pointercancel->ladybug#release lostpointercapture->ladybug#release click->ladybug#nudge"><%= render "shared/ladybug" %></button>
    </div></div><p>今日のあなた、どこでバグる？</p></header>
  <turbo-frame id="bug">
    <section data-controller="collection" data-collection-result-value="<%= @result.to_json %>" data-collection-url-value="<%= @share_url %>" data-collection-day-value="<%= @today.iso8601 %>" data-collection-track-value="<%= @track %>">
      <nav class="category-picker" aria-label="バグのテーマ">
        <% { "all" => "おまかせ" }.merge(BugRoll::CATEGORIES.transform_values(&:first)).each do |key, label| %>
          <%= link_to label, root_path(category: key), class: "category-chip #{'selected' if @selected_category == key}", aria: { current: (@selected_category == key ? "true" : nil) } %>
        <% end %>
      </nav>
      <div class="result-heading"><span class="bug-category"><%= @result[:category] %></span><span class="result-tag"><%= @daily ? "DAILY RARE · #{@day.iso8601}" : (@result[:rare] ? "✦ RARE BUG" : "BUG REPORT") %></span></div>
      <article class="error-box <%= 'rare' if @result[:rare] %>" data-collection-target="card">
        <div class="report-topline"><span><%= @result[:level] %></span><span>深刻度 <%= @result[:severity] %>%</span></div>
        <h2><%= @result[:type] %></h2><p class="bug-message"><%= @result[:message] %></p>
        <div class="severity-track"><span style="width:<%= @result[:severity] %>%"></span></div>
        <p class="severity-caption"><%= @result[:status] %></p>
        <pre class="stack-trace"><%= @result[:trace].join("\n") %></pre>
        <p class="bug-hint"><span>HINT</span> <%= @result[:hint] %></p>
      </article>
      <p class="bug-counter" data-collection-target="stats" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="buttons" data-controller="copy" data-copy-text-value="<%= @result[:text] %>">
        <%= button_to "もう一回バグる", root_path, method: :get, params: { category: @selected_category }, class: "bug-btn", data: { turbo_frame: "bug" } %>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy-target="btn" data-action="copy#copy">コピー</button>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-action="collection#favorite" data-collection-target="favorite" aria-pressed="false">☆ お気に入り</button>
      </div>
      <div class="share-actions">
        <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=<%= ERB::Util.url_encode(@share_text) %>&url=<%= ERB::Util.url_encode(@share_url) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="share-btn">𝕏 投稿</a>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-action="collection#share">リンク共有</button>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-action="collection#saveImage">画像を保存</button>
      </div>
      <p class="action-status" data-collection-target="status" role="status"></p>
      <div class="collection-panel">
        <%= link_to "✦ 今日のレアバグを引く", root_path(category: @selected_category, mode: "daily", day: @today.iso8601), class: "daily-link" %>
        <p class="collection-note">カテゴリごとに毎日ひとつ。同じ日なら同じレアバグ。</p>
        <details><summary>日別の履歴 <span data-collection-target="historyCount"></span></summary><div data-collection-target="history" class="saved-list"></div></details>
        <details><summary>お気に入り <span data-collection-target="favoriteCount"></span></summary><div data-collection-target="favorites" class="saved-list"></div></details>
        <p class="storage-note" data-collection-target="storageNote">履歴は直近30日・100件、お気に入りは50件まで、このブラウザに保存します。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </turbo-frame>
  <footer class="generator-footer"><p>バグを笑いに変えるミニアプリ。</p><p>架空のエラーログで遊ぶ作品です。実際の診断ではありません。</p><a href="https://github.com/mize1978/bug_generator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="github-link">GitHub ↗</a></footer>
</div>
